{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the perfect weekend, filled with adventure and relaxation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is your personal haven of peace and inspiration. Forget the daily hustle and bustle and embark on an amazing journey where a variety of unique and engaging mini-games, hidden-object puzzles, and much more await you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich and Diverse Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy a multitude of unique mini-games and test your skills in exciting hidden-object puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and Exploration:</strong> Complete games to unlock new levels and explore interesting locations. You can look forward to hiking, horseback riding, boating, and serene relaxation throughout an entire weekend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Perfect Way to Relax:</strong> This is not just a game, but an incredible new way to relieve stress, find inner balance, and recharge your creative energy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Collector's Edition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Levels to Explore:</strong> Explore a full twelve new levels, packed with hidden objects and mini-games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Collection of Inspiring Wallpapers:</strong> Download beautiful desktop wallpapers to start every day of the week with inspiration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive Music Player:</strong> Take the sounds of your adventure with you! Listen to the game's soundtrack anytime with a special music player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trophy and Souvenir Room:</strong> Visit a special shop to view all the trophies and souvenirs you've earned over your weekend, and relive the pleasant memories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat yourself to the perfect escape from reality and find your own way to relax and get inspired!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/88dad2cc4a2251f36ba602319206424dad3ea198.jpg"},{"name":" Diamond Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/d2f8768689a4d1d687d57ee410bb7ffca46d8751.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/c2c05dc76ea964bb674d0259271a6f4985944d41.jpg"},{"name":"Mystery Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/4a99f78e6177a92c28fe23d070d9f7ba2efa3c57.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Investigator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/6cb62b5475319da7abcaf0b2c7dd195c96a251a5.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/ccec95b405ecf7d9dab53e60ce7a811e3b97fd77.jpg"},{"name":"Three Musketeers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/18fb9d9d185f3321aaf24b8513ae7bb111c0d02d.jpg"},{"name":"Friend of Raccoons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/1521bcc3ec3b27992ff7832f4c0f2bab4a646f85.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/dc8ae8aeb8148754d4497fea35c7c93684d0285b.jpg"},{"name":"Search Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2839670/5f065275d6028554e762f2c8cd8a7c59c8e26e7c.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2839670?t=1772652924","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2839670?t=1772652924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839670/8dbc499cd2a26e10023da179ebd